## ShellCheck configuration for the msgcollector package.
##
## Mirrors the derivative-maker project policy: msgcollector scripts source
## helper-scripts' get_colors.sh (and siblings), which define many variables at
## runtime from computed paths. ShellCheck cannot follow those sources when a
## staged file is checked in isolation, so it trips on vars it cannot see.
##
##   SC2154 - vars referenced but not assigned (defined in the sourced files).
##   SC2034 - vars assigned but "unused" (read by a sourced child script).
##   SC1090 - "Can't follow non-constant source" (paths from HELPER_SCRIPTS_PATH).
##   SC1091 - "Not following: file not included" (same reason).
disable=SC2154
disable=SC2034
disable=SC1090
disable=SC1091
